cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TrussNet in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TrussNet for Physics-First Sim-to-Real Forecasting of Turbulent Airfoil Wakes"
abstract: >-
  A physics-first transformer that forecasts real turbulent airfoil wakes from PIV measurements with calibrated
  uncertainty bounds. Third place in Track 1 (Sim-to-Real) of the NeurIPS 2026 RealPDE Competition, Team PhysicsOracle.
